{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_12_level_main_12-08_beg","groupId":"main_12","stageId":"main_12-08","title":"熱血年華","storyCode":"12-9","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_12-08_beg.txt","sourceHash":"64177170d2d3b4118a91503d7b7d8ae60f4e48ecaa546e18ae18b3219d27a7d4","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_g2_glasgowoldroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這間房間......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，達格達，這就是我們以前的家！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這裡的日子，一定相當不錯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是當然！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過漢娜從來不打掃衛生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，維娜！我已經承認過很多遍錯誤了好吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們走後，我偶爾會過來一下，收拾收拾，應該和幾年前沒什麼不同吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老子的收藏全都在！貝爾德，果然還是你靠得住啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，誰叫我是那個被留下來看家的可憐人呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別跟我來這套，貝爾德，當初是你自己要留下來的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說你睡覺認床，離開諾伯特區立馬失眠！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許當時我應該努力克服一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉倒吧！你什麼人我還不知道？你要是睡不著，大家就都別想安生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可不想再在睏得要死的時候被你拉著聊天了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈哈，這些日子，我倒是在哪都睡得著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼，太累了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是發現......睡覺是放空大腦的最好方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......等到羅德島的任務結束，貝爾德，我會帶你們離開這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帶你們所有人一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來來來，讓我們開瓶酒慶祝一下這個時隔幾年的重逢吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然都是些便宜貨，但放了那麼久，說不定就變好喝了呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"摩根，給貝爾德看看你寫的那些書！說說我們一路的冒險！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，貝爾德，你可是錯過了成為國王歷險記裡一員的機會——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......摩根？你怎麼了？你好像一直臉色都不是很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們可是好不容易回家了！你應該高興一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在想......我踩到的那隻......手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能只是個意外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那隻手上有一枚扳指，我總覺得我在哪裡見過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我應當記得......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可就是怎麼都想不起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......貝爾德，諾伯特區這些天發生了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......沒什麼，摩根，或許真的只是場意外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家都在努力地活下去，僅此而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些都過去了，你們回來了，我們很快就會離開這裡，這就夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"諾伯特區，這裡是我們的家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想過我們回來時候的樣子，我還以為第一夜我們會去那家撞球廳玩個通宵，再去隔壁那家酒吧喝個天昏地暗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者找影廳的麥克拉倫包場，看十場連續放映的冒險電影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到了，但我不敢仔細看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些碎掉的玻璃和玻璃上乾涸的血，那些倒在裡面的......黑影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你應該像我一樣，好好睡一覺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這一路過來，你們都太累了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維娜，你現在有那把國劍了，你會是那個英雄，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你會救下諾伯特區的，我們會救下諾伯特區的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些都只是暫時的艱難罷了，對吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......當然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們會奪回過去的生活的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，已經很晚了，休息吧，夥計們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明天還有一大堆事情要忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"貝爾德說的對，摩根，我們都需要......好好休息一下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_g2_glasgowoldroom"},{"type":"narration","text":"推進之王蜷縮在沙發上，她曾經在這裡度過無數個夜晚，這裡的每一寸觸感她仍然熟悉。\n她還記得很多年前，她們在舊貨市場上淘到了這張老沙發，四個人花了吃奶的力氣才把這破東西搬上拳館的二樓。\n在那時，這座沙發對於她還稱得上是寬廣，很快，她就得把腳翹在扶手上才能在這裡容身。\n在黑暗中，推進之王的手撫過沙發的每一寸。\n這裡是漢娜練習耍她那把小刀時留下的劃痕，她當時為此內疚了三天。\n摩根曾把一大瓶飲料灑在這裡，她買了罐劣質清潔劑來處理污漬，最後越弄越糟，至今都留有大片滑膩的痕跡。\n貝爾德把熨斗放在沙發上忘了關，差點燒著了整個房間。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_i03"},{"type":"narration","text":"她曾以為這樣的日子永遠不會變。\n她曾堅信這樣的日子永遠不會變。\n這裡是她們的格拉斯哥幫，她們的街區，她們成長的地方，她們的家。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"是的，她回來了。\n可她的心中，卻沒有一絲欣喜。\n她又想起了摩根的那本“回憶錄”，《偉大的維娜陛下和她偉大的朋友們》。\n推進之王輕輕觸碰著放在身邊的諸王之息。\n那把劍依然冰冷如初。\n領袖。英雄。國王。\n推進之王維娜。\n亞歷山德莉娜·維娜·維多利亞。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了，維娜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這件衣服太重了，睡覺時壓得我喘不過氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想找幾件更舒服的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那個抽屜裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來你這些年沒長個，嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我們都多大了，早過了長個子的年紀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"成長這東西可說不準，我記得我們第一次遇見的時候，你明明才那麼高......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了行了，又是你那套感歎時間流逝的老話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些老話，我可是很多年沒有可以講的對象了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉，貝爾德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回來就好，維娜陛下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......別這麼叫我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就還是叫你，推進之王。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_g10_wildbattlefield"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了，埃芒加德女士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別叫我女士，我還沒那麼老。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，埃芒加德......小姐？我搞不太清你們巫妖的年紀......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，算了，就叫我埃芒加德女士吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這艘高速軍艦毀得還真徹底，嘖，血魔的人還又把這裡洗了一遍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"曼弗雷德將軍說，這會是薩卡茲勝利的開始。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，薩卡茲的勝利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，那位凱爾希女士一再警告我，這樣的未來無法給我們帶來任何東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我還是不明白，我的老師為什麼會有一位菲林老朋友？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，我討厭這裡的味道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"請跟我來，特蕾西婭殿下在等您。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_g1_glasgowboxinggym"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，早安。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們需要對接下來的行動......做出安排了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲把這些平民當做他們不被炮火直接襲擊的保險，但無論是軍事委員會還是大公爵，我們都不能真的相信他們的仁慈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算我們無視這些正發生在他們之間的博弈，現在封鎖區的糟糕狀況，我們也都看在眼裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們已經看到了如今諾伯特區的混亂情況，要改變現狀並不容易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們帶來的那些藥物......我清點過數量，恐怕只是杯水車薪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，僅僅憑藉我們，能做到的事情實在有限，但這不是我們裹足不前的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"針對飛空艇的調查和對地塊平民的撤離計劃必須同時展開，我們不能忽視任何一邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了，戴菲恩小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們很厲害，對吧？你們能穿過薩卡茲的封鎖來到這裡，你們應該同樣能輕鬆抽身而出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以驕傲地說，現在聚集在這裡的都是羅德島了不起的幹員，但是很抱歉，戴菲恩小姐，我們恐怕沒有你想像的那麼強大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相比於那些戰爭背後的操縱者，我們甚至稱得上十足弱小。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以......你們是接受了幫助才能進來這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按那位先生一直強調的說法，恐怕該說成是“交易”，而且很不光彩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是......薩卡茲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"某位大公爵居然與另一批薩卡茲達成了合作......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，看來你琢磨的東西很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，我只是經常讀報罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是個好習慣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們正在策劃一場撤離行動，是嗎？你們背後的那位大人物承諾了幫忙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很遺憾，沒有，她看起來並不在乎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是你們顯然很在乎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，這些人可是羅德島。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我對此不發表意見，我更關心我們能不能活著離開這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有一個提議，羅德島的各位，這可能有點冒險......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲封鎖了所有諾伯特區向外傳遞消息的管道，我能猜到他們對外的說辭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信，無論是哪個大公爵，都很清楚那不過是“說辭”而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但他們不會主動戳破，不如說，大公爵和卡茲戴爾軍事委員會反倒在這一點上達成了默契。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲把這地塊上的人當盾牌，大公爵們何嘗不是？我猜，要是這裡的人被薩卡茲殺了個一乾二淨，有幾位大公爵反倒會長舒一口氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在一場戰爭中，某些人只會把道德視作負擔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，您說的沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們......就打破這種默契。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們必須推一把大公爵們，逼迫他們更果斷地行動起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......在我們真的全都死在這裡之前。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_offce"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好幾天了，戈爾丁，你總是一言不發。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就我們所知，你不是個如此沉默的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倫蒂尼姆市民自救軍的情況怎麼樣了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們離開了這座城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還剩下多少人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，又是沉默。沉默能給你帶來安寧嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是在......回憶他們，回憶他們每一個人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，好啦，戈爾丁，你並不天然地屬於他們，你自然也可以忘卻這一種虛無的歸屬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"並不是你親手殺了他們，大部分人本就會死在這場戰爭裡。你們甚至為此發明了一個詞，“犧牲”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些名字，那些藏匿於名字之後的人，大部分你甚至都從未見過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"成為一個集體的一員能讓你感到快樂和驕傲嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很遺憾，如你所見，我們只能歸屬於我們自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我曾以為是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在一開始，我以為我為之奮鬥的是我們共同的夢想，是自救軍的事業。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這幾天我發現，或許並非如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊托說的話是對的，我們都是一類人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾說他悲觀......我又何嘗不是呢。不管我自己承不承認......我都是一個容易失望的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自救軍的成員們或許是懷著純潔的理念而奮鬥的人，但是自救軍本身不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論是克洛維希婭還是阿勒黛......我尊重她們的為人，可是她們的目的絕不僅僅像是嘴上說的那樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在很長一段時間裡，假裝自己對這些毫無察覺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你現在為此感到幻滅了。你終於察覺到你的事業從一開始就並非純潔無瑕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得你的努力都是徒勞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我不去想什麼事業，我只是在想那些人。那一張張的面孔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海蒂、費斯特、洛洛、老比爾、亞當斯、小喬治......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有資格，也沒有權利自稱我該為倫蒂尼姆市民自救軍悔罪。我不需屬於那些虛幻的集體。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我需要......在心中面對他們每一個人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
